# Env / Firebase / OCID

- Client env vars must be accessed via `import.meta.env` and use the **`VITE_`** prefix.
- Firebase usage should go through shared modules in `src/lib/*` when available (avoid scattering SDK init or auth listeners across components).
- Auth/session UI should use `useAuth()` from `src/stores/authStore.ts` for `profile`, `isAuthenticated`, `hasRole`, etc.
- OCID connect is wrapped at app root (`OCConnect` in `src/main.tsx`). For connect flows, follow the existing pattern using `useOCAuth()` and redirect-based sign-in.
